# score: Telar que respira
# summary: 10 bars / 3 voices / ~0.8 min — a bowed loom breathing in D; the high strings twist (chirality) and bend (curvature) while they ring
# tempo: 50
# time: 4/4
# key: Dm
# bars: 10
# reverb: 2.6
# master: rms=-17

# text @b1: a nine-course string, bowed slowly through a /u/ body, with breath in the bow
# text @b3: three strummed courses above it; their twist runs from -0.8 to +0.8 across each note
# text @b7: a plucked line comes in, the loom answering itself

# instruments:
#   dr = el pecho (bass, synth=weave, bodyp=u, courses=9, couple=0.12, bow=0.42, bow_speed=0.3, breath=0.3, sus=8, damp=0.2, body=0.9, body_size=1.6, detune=4, send=0.3, gain=-3)
#   hi = las torcidas (treble, synth=weave, courses=3, strum=0.35, orbit=0.6, orbit_depth=0.7, couple=0.2, sus=6, damp=0.25, body=0.5, send=0.45, gain=-6)
#   pk = el arpa (treble, synth=pluck, courses=2, pos=0.15, pick=0.8, sus=3, damp=0.3, send=0.35, gain=-8)

bar 1: dr={p} D2w[bodyp=u]  hi=-  pk=-
bar 2: dr=D2w[bodyp=o]  hi=-  pk=-
bar 3: dr={mp} D2w[bodyp=u]  hi={p} <A4 D5 E5>w[chirality=-0.8->0.8,curvature=0.1->0.7]  pk=-
bar 4: dr=Bb1w[bodyp=o]  hi=<F4 Bb4 D5>w[chirality=0.8->-0.8,curvature=0.7->0.2]  pk=-
bar 5: dr=C2w[bodyp=a]  hi=<G4 C5 E5>w[chirality=-0.6->0.9,curvature=0.2->0.9]  pk=-
bar 6: dr=A1w[bodyp=u]  hi=<E4 A4 C#5>w[chirality=0.9->-0.9,curvature=0.9->0.1]  pk=-
bar 7: dr=D2w[bodyp=u]  hi=<A4 D5 F5>w[chirality=-0.3->0.3]  pk={mp} Rq D5e F5e A5q G5e F5e
bar 8: dr=Bb1w[bodyp=o]  hi=<F4 Bb4 D5>w[chirality=0.3->-0.3]  pk=E5q. D5e C5q A4q
bar 9: dr={p} D2w[bodyp=u]  hi={pp} <A4 D5 E5>w[curvature=0.5->0.0]  pk=D5h Rh
bar 10: dr=-  hi=-  pk=-
